# ─── Never commit these ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Program confidentiality: most programs forbid disclosing findings without
# written consent. Pushing evidence to a public repo is a rules violation and
# can void your safe harbour protection.

# Evidence and recon output — contains real data, PII and screenshots
evidence/
recon/
**/evidence/
**/recon/

# Live working documents — findings, hypotheses, session logs
programs/*/notes.md
programs/*/findings.md
programs/*/hypotheses.md

# Proxy captures and session material
*.pcap
*.pcapng
*.har
*.burp
*.session
cookies.txt
*_cookie*

# Credentials and environment
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
secrets.*

# JavaScript collector dependencies and private session files
node_modules/
storage-state*.json
auth-headers*.json

# ─── Keep templates tracked ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# templates/ is committed on purpose — it is the blank scaffolding.
!templates/*.md

# ─── OS and editor noise ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
